<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - TBN - 140,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Milaki $7 to $7.50 fio scale load/14,000 shinc 10-24/4 Cetragpa.</p>
<p>TBN - 140,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Ensted $7.50 fio sale load/35,000 shinc 15-30/4 Elsam.</p>
<p>TBN - 110,000 tonnes coal Newport News/Constanza approx. $7.50 fio 30,000 shinc/20,000 shex 1-9/4 Eurasia Express Line.</p>
<p>Bear G - 70,000 tonnes coal Maraciabo/Dunkirk east $10.25 fio 22,500 shinc/25,000 shinc 25/3-10/4 Cetragpa.</p>
<p>ORE- There were no fresh ore fixtures reported on Monday.</p>
